Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快向生物的远古祖先打声招呼吧 Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这化石虫已经生存了三十亿年了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是军事秘密 为什么你想知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是说过吗 我对你一见钟情\N有关你的事我全都想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你瞳孔的颜色 你秀发的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有你那柔软的唇部
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些也都是军事秘密吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海贼Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,左手装备有枪的宇宙海贼\N是恶名昭彰的大海贼\N身上背负着七条命案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然被你说得这么坏\N但确实我是会做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你却不了解我 我只有一半是坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.81,0:00:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剩下的一半是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更加坏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住 这前面禁止入内\N这是地球政府的调查地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在找由多皮亚.莫亚博士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这家伙是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我的身份证明文件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...这就是宇宙的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事到如今你还要说是秘密吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.10,0:01:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙路巴.多鲁 欢迎来到我的城堡\N沙堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,毒品?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是令人吃惊 这可是品牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是海贼工会的标志吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伯爵那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还剩下五分钟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.73,0:04:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在找人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思 似乎是弄错房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用这么急着走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们好难才能相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.93,0:04:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水晶男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你应该知道我为何会被叫水晶男孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的身体是由特殊活水晶躯壳制成的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何的光线枪以及热线枪都对我无效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的精神感应枪也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是试试你到底是否是真的水晶男孩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过这个又如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行 这只手也对我无效
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么 不必要担心\N应该只是发生了点小事故吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我下去看看 你留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等下 伯爵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.81,0:06:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伯爵!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快上来 我们去兜风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打算干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从这里逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何是好?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去追 别让他们逃了!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伯爵是海贼工会的成员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他仓库下全藏的是毒品
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会 他可是贵族你说贵族是海贼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,工会里有各种各样的人 有医生也有律师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要说福利学校的牧师也是海贼的话\N这也不是奇事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且再加上水晶男孩也在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水晶男孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是工会的杀手\N全身都是用水晶制成的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说的这些简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女人就是对贵族没抵抗力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你喜欢玩死亡穿梭吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在大磁气云层中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.39,0:08:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多亏了在这云层中穿梭的磁电气\N导弹才能被炸飞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是说了我讨厌死亡穿梭吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶 完全失控了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,左边的引擎也被击坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跳下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 又来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么和一起乘飞机时\N最后总是不得不跳下去呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是巧啊 我也在想着同样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样你就相信了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的目标是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会没事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我满嘴都是沙了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你那美丽的臀部受伤的话\N我可是会很伤心的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说谁会伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你下地狱去吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.10,0:10:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里就是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你指什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你指什么要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是说地狱的使者的话 那可多得是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra! 抓住它!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是遗憾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难得猎物自投罗网了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是再造人吧 懂得品尝美酒的味道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前也曾有人这么问过我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦~那人后来如何了?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是海贼工会太阳系方面司令官\N雷德.波恩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我代表工会转告波鲁多伯爵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是否已经得到宇宙诞生的秘密\N创造出银河的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 请再给我些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没时间了 工会非常急需这力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓紧时间 伯爵 不允许有丝毫差错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总部已经急不可待了 所以要你\N尽快找到那秘密交给总部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忠告吗 男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你只是我雇佣的工会杀手而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 我只是浪迹天涯的杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有钱 任何人都可以杀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我才担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你有天一败涂地付不起钱\N而其他工会的干部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,却付得起钱要我杀你的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别摆出这种表情\N你现在仍然是我的BOSS.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 刚才那个男人他说他叫沙路巴.多鲁吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你认识吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的外号叫拥有不死之身的男人\N海贼Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂~你打算这样待到什么时候?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道 去问鲸鱼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是它飞厌了\N那顺道停在加油站或车站也行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra你为什么要救我?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的目的到底是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.73,0:14:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也想得到创造出银河的力量吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙诞生的秘密吗 我才不稀罕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 你的目的是海贼工会吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.31,0:14:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉我 Cobra\N你过去和工会之间到底发生了什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们夺取了我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夺取了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的梦想被他们夺取了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦想?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真狡猾 明明是小偷却流露出这么\N悲伤的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快看 不好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自从遇见了你之后就没一件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要走着回去 别管我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要走到纽约吗\N那你在前面往右转再步行约\N一亿二千万公里左右吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了 我很熟悉这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我带路 你跟着来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,女士先
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么鬼地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 你不是很熟悉这里的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这个人真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真叫人吃惊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里好像是古代的神殿的遗迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,建筑古老啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概有两千年以上的历史
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那石壁上的门是海贼工会的纹章\N那里是他们的据点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会这样 真是没用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还以为已经逃了他们的魔掌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吗 我是佐治.基利安 我要入伙如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,入伙 你以为我们是谁!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是阿里巴巴和四十盗贼吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然不知道你是谁\N但看起来似乎是个不知道这是\N吉普赛.斗克的据点的笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当然知道 所以才带着见面礼来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们正在找这个女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这混蛋 到底是什么人?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也很想加入你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.43,0:17:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了 胖子 瞄准了 是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要宰了你!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.23,0:18:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有意思的家伙 我很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也很有胆识
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将那个男人带到据点来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:18:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用客气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是可爱的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哟 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们今天去了一个村庄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:14.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我们是去干什么的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去购物吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说去购物 这家伙真是会说笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看这个 这是我赤手空拳杀死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你杀了什么 垃圾吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他好像醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由多皮亚 你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.35,0:19:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么啊 滚一边去 狼心狗肺的家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来似乎很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去找找从这里逃出去的方法\N等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我之后回来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁会相信恶党说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快拿酒来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.81,0:20:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 回答我!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 听得到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra怎么了 我一直都没收到你的联系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我之前都在沙漠里\N那里磁场太强无法取得通讯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱迪 你清楚我现在的位置吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道 是在森林地带吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到你那需要两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.64,0:20:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 你马上赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你最好还是别出去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为就快到深夜了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些家伙要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,究竟会有什么即将出现?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他们抢回来的村民们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.39,0:21:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才的是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是千钧一发啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多亏了你救了我们 你是我们的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.81,0:22:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是达古
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.48,0:22:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫嘉尔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫普森
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说啊 恩人 真是很残忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别看我们这样我们可是出色的工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实我们是被那吉普森.斗克雇佣而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可是天才的工程师\N任何东西都能制造
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别说是飞机还是宇宙船 甚至连汽车也行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个次元移动潜艇的引擎也是我们制造的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是造完之后不单不付钱\N还将我们变成结草虫的粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快看 米葢尔已经惨遭毒手了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真惨 都已经溶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么 这些结草虫到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.56,0:23:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恩人 你不知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.23,0:23:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结草虫族会将动物困住然后使他们慢慢熔化
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.35,0:23:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,熔化的液体会这样被收集起来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.89,0:23:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是毒品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,结草虫通过熔化生物从而制造出毒品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.43,0:23:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动物 特别是人类能制成高纯度的毒品
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来这就是你们虏人的目的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.31,0:23:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这可是一笔不错的买卖 能赚钱\N而且还是大量的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也让我参一把吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要和我合伙?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这主意不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:24:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听到了吗 他说要和我合伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.31,0:24:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.89,0:24:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是单不错的生意\N当海贼可以从村民那夺取钱财
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.43,0:24:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又能作为领主索取他们的税金
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完美无缺
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.64,0:24:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直以来都是很出色的担当着两个角色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.31,0:24:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀了他!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.27,0:24:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是算了吧吃了我会肚子痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.35,0:25:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我本来是不杀女人的\N但看来现在身不由己
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.77,0:25:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是漂亮 不愧是Cobra 身手不凡
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.81,0:25:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别动!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:18.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一动这个女人就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传说中的男人Cobra今天也就丧命于此了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.18,0:25:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,时间弹
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.43,0:25:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它会令中弹者身边的时间流逝速度\N减慢至万分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你已经变成活雕像了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一直在研究化石虫
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并且解开了刻在贝壳上的古代文字
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.14,0:26:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你也应该找到创造宇宙的秘密了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该清楚那秘密藏在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.27,0:26:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把那资料交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.35,0:26:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁会交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.81,0:26:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我出生在有教养的家庭中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.48,0:26:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不想向你施刑或者伤害你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或者
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.27,0:26:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我把你扔进外面那些流氓无赖堆里去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.10,0:26:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你本身明明就是那些流氓无赖的首领
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不明白在这里能保护你的\N只有我一人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.23,0:26:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会自己选择保护的人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.02,0:26:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他已经无法保护你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.77,0:27:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他身边的时间流逝速度减慢至万分之一了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是痛苦却会是一万倍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.02,0:27:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想救他吗 那就把资料交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.93,0:27:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我劲部的项链里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.77,0:27:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你 这样他就不用饱受痛苦的死去了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.89,0:28:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.89,0:29:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被伯爵射中了时间弹
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想活活的折磨死本大爷 真是有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.68,0:29:43.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这仇我一定会报
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.14,0:29:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并且水晶男孩 我绝对无法原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Cobra精神感应枪要用心去射
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.48,0:29:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了 莱迪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.18,0:29:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就用这一击了结一切吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.98,0:29:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集的Cobra the Animation:\NThe Psychogun Volume 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.39,0:30:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敬请收看
